<rml>
<head><title>Melee-PC</title><link type="text/rcss" href="launcher.rcss" /></head>
<body>
  <div id="shell">
    <div class="topline"><span class="brand">MELEE / PC</span><span class="edition">NTSC-U 1.02</span></div>
    <div class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">SUPER SMASH BROS.</div><h1>MELEE</h1></div>
    <div id="home">
      <div class="columns">
        <div class="menu">
          <button id="play" class="primary">Play Melee</button>
          <button id="choose">Choose disc</button>
          <button id="verify">Verify disc</button>
          <button id="settings">Settings</button>
          <button id="quit" class="quiet">Quit</button>
        </div>
        <div class="disc-card">
          <div class="eyebrow">DISC</div>
          <h2 id="disc-name">No disc selected</h2>
          <p id="disc-info">Melee, USA revision 2 (NTSC-U 1.02).</p>
          <p id="disc-path" class="path">ISO · GCM · CISO · RVZ</p>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p class="note">Drop a disc image here, or use Choose disc. The path is remembered.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="preferences">
      <div id="settings-window">
        <div id="settings-heading">
          <h2>Settings</h2>
          <span class="version">NTSC-U 1.02</span>
        </div>
        <div id="tabstrip">
          <button id="tab-graphics" class="tab">Graphics</button>
          <button id="tab-audio" class="tab">Audio &amp; interface</button>
          <button id="tab-controls" class="tab">Controls</button>
        </div>
        <div id="settings-content">
          <div id="page-graphics" class="page">
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Display mode</h3><p>Choose windowed or fullscreen.</p></div>
              <button id="display">Display</button>
            </div>
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Vertical sync</h3><p>Synchronise presentation with your display.</p></div>
              <button id="sync">VSync</button>
            </div>
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Internal resolution</h3><p>Auto follows the window size.</p></div>
              <div class="slider-control">
                <input type="range" class="range" id="resolution" min="0" max="10" step="1" value="0" />
                <span id="resolution-val" class="slider-value">Auto</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Aspect ratio</h3><p>Applies to fights. Menus and the HUD stay 4:3.</p></div>
              <button id="aspect">Original 4:3</button>
            </div>
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Anti-aliasing <span class="badge">RESTART</span></h3><p>Smooth polygon edges with multisampling.</p></div>
              <button id="aa">Anti-aliasing</button>
            </div>
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Anisotropic filtering <span class="badge">RESTART</span></h3><p>Improve supported textures viewed at an angle.</p></div>
              <button id="filter">Filtering</button>
            </div>
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Post-processing filter</h3><p>Off presents the frame as rendered.</p></div>
              <button id="filter-mode">Off</button>
            </div>
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Graphics backend <span class="badge">RESTART</span></h3><p>Choose Direct3D 12 or Vulkan.</p></div>
              <button id="backend">Auto</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="page-audio" class="page">
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Master volume</h3><p>Use left/right arrows or drag slider.</p></div>
              <div class="slider-control">
                <input type="range" class="range" id="volume" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="100" />
                <span id="volume-val" class="slider-value">100%</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Mute audio</h3><p>Silence audio output without changing volume.</p></div>
              <button id="mute">Mute</button>
            </div>
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>Performance display</h3><p>Show the current frame rate.</p></div>
              <button id="fps">FPS counter</button>
            </div>
            <div class="setting">
              <div class="description"><h3>UI scale</h3><p>Scale launcher and overlay elements.</p></div>
              <div class="slider-control">
                <input type="range" class="range" id="scale" min="75" max="150" step="25" value="100" />
                <span id="scale-val" class="slider-value">100%</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="page-controls" class="page">
            <div class="section controls">
              <div class="section-heading"><h2>Keyboard</h2></div>
              <p>WASD / arrows Move · X Attack · Z Special · C / V Jump · Q / E Shield<br/>Tab Grab · Enter Start · IJKL C-stick</p>
            </div>
            <div class="section controls">
              <div class="section-heading"><h2>Controller</h2></div>
              <p>Remap a gamepad from the in-game menu: press BACK on the pad, or F1, then open Controls. Controllers are only detected once the game is running.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="settings-bottom">
          <p id="settings-status">Saved automatically.</p>
          <button id="back" class="primary">Back to launcher</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="status">No disc selected.</div>
    <div class="footer">ARROWS / D-PAD Navigate <span>ENTER / A Select</span><span>ESC / B Back</span></div>
  </div>
</body>
</rml>
